# Template for env/<env>.secrets.env (gitignored; create on the machine that runs that environment, mode 600).
# List secret variable NAMES here with empty values; never put a real value in this tracked file.
# Compose loads env/<env>.env first, then env/<env>.secrets.env (optional), so a secret overrides nothing public.
# Later: the same filenames can be encrypted in place with SOPS + age.
#
# EXAMPLE_API_KEY=
#
# Social feed (GET /api/posts), prod only, in env/prod.secrets.env. Read only when
# SOCIAL_FEED_PROVIDER=typefully. Typefully keys carry the creating user's full permissions
# (they can publish), so treat it as a full credential: create it in Typefully (Settings -> API),
# type it straight into the file on the box, never paste it anywhere else.
TYPEFULLY_API_KEY=
